  "comments": [
    {
      "position": 0,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "? Unclearly seen/Obscurely\n\n遠くに富士山がぼんやり見える。\nMt. Fuji can been seen dimly in the distance.\n\nこの漢字をぼんやりとしたが覚えていない。\nI have but a faint recollection of this kanji.\n\n朝ご飯食べなかったので、頭がぼんやりしているよ。\nI can't think clearly because I didnt eat breakfast\n\n? Carelessness\n\nぼんやりと海を眺めていた。\nHe was gazing vacently at the ocean.\n\nぼんやりするな！\nBe careful! (Don't space out!)\n\n?　Doing nothing at all\nぼんやりと暮らす\nidle one's time away\n\n? Insenstive remarks\n\nぼんやりした人\ndimwit, blockhead, slow, thickheaded",
      "html": "? Unclearly seen/Obscurely<br/><br/>遠くに富士山がぼんやり見える。<br/>Mt. Fuji can been seen dimly in the distance.<br/><br/>この漢字をぼんやりとしたが覚えていない。<br/>I have but a faint recollection of this kanji.<br/><br/>朝ご飯食べなかったので、頭がぼんやりしているよ。<br/>I can't think clearly because I didnt eat breakfast<br/><br/>? Carelessness<br/><br/>ぼんやりと海を眺めていた。<br/>He was gazing vacently at the ocean.<br/><br/>ぼんやりするな！<br/>Be careful! (Don't space out!)<br/><br/>?　Doing nothing at all<br/>ぼんやりと暮らす<br/>idle one's time away<br/><br/>? Insenstive remarks<br/><br/>ぼんやりした人<br/>dimwit, blockhead, slow, thickheaded",
      "credits_raw": "aoiaki",
